    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Aga Khan University Examination Board (AKU-EB) presented awards to the top position holders from the Secondary School Certificate ( SSC) Part One, SSC Composite and Higher Secondary School Certificate (HSSC) Part One Examinations from across Pakistan. The three top positions holders for SSC Composite Examinations were: Syeda Iqra Akber from Al Murtaza School, Karachi, who won the first position with 91.53%, followed by Mohammad Hasnain Mamdani from Al Murtaza School, Karachi at second position with 90.12%. Nihaan Shahzad and Kiran Abdul Rauf from Habib Girls School, Karachi both achieved third position with 90%. In addition to merit certificates these candidates were awarded cash scholarships from AKU-EB.",
